            "bbox": [
              100,
              460,
              600,
              721.66
            ],
            "text": "**Strategies for Platform Growth** **1. Achieving Critical Mass** - Incentives for early adopters (e.g., discounts, exclusive features). - Partnerships to attract complementary goods or services. **2. Reducing Multi-homing** - Offer unique features or better integration. - Loyalty programs to encourage single-platform usage. **3. Managing Lock-in** - Continually innovate to minimize user churn. - Provide seamless migration tools to reduce perceived switching costs.",
            "summary": "Strategies for platform growth: critical mass, reducing multi-homing, managing lock-in.",
