            "text": "**Challenges in Platform Ecosystems** **1. Balancing Growth and Quality** - Rapid scaling can dilute user experience. - Quality control mechanisms are essential. **2. Overcoming Network Saturation** - Growth slows as saturation approaches. - Diversification of offerings can help maintain momentum. **3. Managing Competition** - New entrants may disrupt established ecosystems. - Continuous innovation is key to staying ahead.",
